check 1
# Horadric Cube recipe 4: 3 health potions +  3 mana potions + 1 chipped gem -> rejuvenate potion
# cubemain row 4: inputs hpot,qty=3 mpot,qty=3 gem0 -> output rvs. Generated by tools/checks/gen_cube.py
# (specs/world/cube.md §1-§8): ScnCube holds a cube (page 0) and the inputs (page 3)
# from the start; frame 4 opens the cube (0x20 UseGridItem, §1), frame 8 transmutes
# (0x4F ClickButton 0x18, §3). Compared: state + packets (0x9D action 5 per removed
# item, 0x9C action 4 per output, §8).
name cube-004-3-health-potions-3-mana-potion
save ScnCube --class ama --expansion --item box --item hp1:3 --item hp1:3 --item hp1:3 --item mp1:3 --item mp1:3 --item mp1:3 --item gcv:3
seed 1234
ticks 24
seconds 300
channels state packets items
at 4 send UseGridItem item=@1 x=@x y=@y
at 8 send ClickButton button=0x18 p1=0 p2=0
